<title>USA: Lincolnton, N.C., bonds repriced, yields lowered.</title>
<headline>Lincolnton, N.C., bonds repriced, yields lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Robinson-Humphrey Co said Monday it repriced Lincolnton, N.C.'s $23.31 million bond deal, lowering the top yield in 2021 to approximately 5.544 percent from 5.582 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
